    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "What is it about his tiny size that you find so good? What kind of qualities do you appreciate in him?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T09:28:18.101726+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, he's so tiny! And what about his personality? I love how open and curious he is. He's just such a fun little baby.",
